@{
    ViewBag.Title = "Home";
}

<div class="jumbotron text-center" style="background: linear-gradient(120deg, #2c3e50, #3498db); color: white; border-radius: 10px;">
    <h1>Welcome to Minnesota State Project</h1>
    <p class="lead">Explore information about Minnesota, its culture, and attractions.</p>
</div>

<div class="container">

    <div class="row text-center">

        <div class="col-md-4">
            <div class="well">
                <img src="@Url.Content("~/Content/images/nature.jpg")"
                     class="img-responsive img-rounded"
                     style="height:200px; width:100%; object-fit:cover;" />
                <h3>🌲 Nature</h3>
                <p>Minnesota is known for its 10,000 lakes, forests, and outdoor beauty.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="col-md-4">
            <div class="well">
                <img src="@Url.Content("~/Content/images/city.jpg")"
                     class="img-responsive img-rounded"
                     style="height:200px; width:100%; object-fit:cover;" />
                <h3>🏙 Cities</h3>
                <p>Explore Minneapolis, St. Paul, and many vibrant communities.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="col-md-4">
            <div class="well">
                <img src="@Url.Content("~/Content/images/fair.jpg")"
                     class="img-responsive img-rounded"
                     style="height:200px; width:100%; object-fit:cover;" />
                <h3>🎡 State Fair</h3>
                <p>One of the largest and most popular state fairs in the U.S.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

    </div>

    <!-- MORE ABOUT SECTION -->
    <div class="panel panel-primary" style="margin-top:40px;">

        <div class="panel-heading text-center">
            <h3 class="panel-title">More About the Minnesota State Fair</h3>
        </div>

        <div class="panel-body">

            <div style="text-align:center;">
                <img src="@Url.Content("~/Content/images/food.jpg")"
                     class="img-responsive img-rounded"
                     style="display:inline-block; margin-bottom:15px;" />
            </div>

            <p>
                The Minnesota State Fair is one of the largest and most popular state fairs in the United States,
                attracting millions of visitors each year. It is well known for its wide variety of entertainment,
                food, shopping, and cultural exhibits that showcase the spirit of Minnesota.
            </p>

            <p>
                One of the main highlights of the fair is the large number of vendors. These vendors come from all over
                and offer many different products including handmade crafts, clothing, artwork, toys, and unique souvenirs.
                Visitors enjoy walking through the fairgrounds and exploring the many booths and stands that sell creative
                and one-of-a-kind items.
            </p>

            <p>
                The fair is also famous for its food vendors, which offer a huge variety of options. Traditional fair foods
                like corn dogs, cheese curds, burgers, and BBQ are very popular, but visitors also enjoy unique and creative
                items such as deep-fried candy bars, pickles, and other special treats that are only found at the fair.
            </p>

            <p>
                In addition to food and shopping, the fair features many small knickknack vendors selling souvenirs,
                handmade jewelry, custom shirts, wood crafts, and decorative items. These products allow visitors to take
                home a memory of their experience at the fair.
            </p>

            <p>
                Overall, the Minnesota State Fair is more than just an event — it is a large celebration of food,
                culture, entertainment, and community where people can explore, shop, and enjoy unique experiences every year.
            </p>

        </div>
    </div>


    <div style="margin:60px 0;">
        <hr style="border-top:3px solid #337ab7; width:70%; margin:auto;" />
    </div>

    <div class="card"
         style="width:100%; margin-bottom:50px; box-shadow:0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.2); border-radius:10px; overflow:hidden;">

        <img src="@Url.Content("~/Content/images/Security.jpg")"
             class="card-img-top img-responsive"
             alt="Security Update"
             style="width:100%; height:600px; object-fit:cover;" />

        <div class="card-header" style="background-color:#337ab7; color:white; padding:15px;">
            <h3 style="margin:0;">Security Update</h3>
        </div>

        <div class="card-body" style="padding:20px;">

            <h4 class="card-title">Improved Security Measures</h4>

            <p class="card-text">
                Since updating our security systems, everything has remained positive.
                No issues or incidents have been reported, and the new measures continue
                to improve the safety and reliability of the system.
            </p>

            <p class="card-text">
                We have strengthened our platform by implementing enhanced account protection,
                secure data encryption, and improved monitoring systems designed to detect and
                prevent unauthorized access. Regular security updates and system maintenance
                help ensure that our services remain safe, stable, and trustworthy for all users.
            </p>

            <p class="card-text">
                Protecting customer privacy is one of our highest priorities. We are committed
                to safeguarding personal information and ensuring that customer data is handled
                responsibly and securely. Our team continuously reviews security practices and
                follows industry standards to maintain a secure environment where users can feel
                confident and protected while using our services.
            </p>

            <p class="card-text">
                As technology continues to evolve, we remain focused on improving our security
                infrastructure and investing in new solutions that enhance privacy, reliability,
                and customer trust. We value our customers and believe that maintaining strong
                security practices is essential to providing the best possible experience.
            </p>

        </div>

    </div>
    <div class="card"
         style="width:100%; margin-bottom:50px; box-shadow:0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.2); border-radius:10px; overflow:hidden;">

        <img src="@Url.Content("~/Content/images/Vendors.jpg")"
             class="card-img-top img-responsive"
             alt="Vendors Update"
             style="width:100%; height:600px; object-fit:cover;" />

        <div class="card-header" style="background-color:#28a745; color:white; padding:15px;">
            <h3 style="margin:0;">Vendors Update</h3>
        </div>

        <div class="card-body" style="padding:20px;">

            <h4 class="card-title">Improved Vendor Experience</h4>

            <p class="card-text">
                We are continuously working to improve the experience for all vendors by making
                it easier to register, manage listings, and interact with customers on our platform.
                Recent updates have streamlined the vendor onboarding process and improved overall usability.
            </p>

            <p class="card-text">
                Vendors now benefit from faster product uploads, better inventory management tools,
                and improved visibility across the platform. These enhancements help businesses reach
                more customers and operate more efficiently.
            </p>

            <p class="card-text">
                We value our vendor community and recognize their important role in providing quality
                products and services. Our goal is to create a fair, secure, and supportive environment
                where vendors can grow their business with confidence.
            </p>

            <p class="card-text">
                Future updates will continue to focus on improving performance, security, and user experience
                for vendors, ensuring the platform remains reliable and easy to use for everyone involved.
            </p>

        </div>

    </div>

    <div class="card"
         style="width:100%; margin-bottom:50px; box-shadow:0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.2); border-radius:10px; overflow:hidden;">

        <div class="card-header" style="background-color:#007bff; color:white; padding:15px;">
            <h3 style="margin:0;">Business Opportunity</h3>
        </div>

        <div class="card-body" style="padding:20px;">

            <h4 class="card-title">Partner With Us</h4>

            <p class="card-text">
                We are always open to new business opportunities and partnerships.
                Please fill out the form below and our team will get back to you.
            </p>

    
            <div class="mb-3">
                <label for="emailInput" class="form-label">Email address</label>
                <input type="email"
                       class="form-control"
                       id="emailInput"
                       placeholder="name@example.com" />
            </div>

           
            <div class="mb-3">
                <label for="nameInput" class="form-label">Full Name</label>
                <input type="text"
                       class="form-control"
                       id="nameInput"
                       placeholder="Enter your name" />
            </div>

            <div class="mb-3">
                <label for="messageInput" class="form-label">For More Information</label>
                <textarea class="form-control"
                          id="messageInput"
                          rows="5"
                          placeholder=""></textarea>
            </div>

          
            <button class="btn btn-primary">
                Submit
            </button>

        </div>
    </div>


</div>
